flowchart TB
  public[Public setup / ordinary result once] --> before[Opt-in public before observation / private WeakMap]
  before -. explicit composition only .-> executor[Public core executor / reserve once]
  executor --> factory[Canonical factory reader SH]
  factory --> product[Canonical product reader SH]
  product --> subjects[Private verifier / exact sources receipts / issuer port]
  subjects --> launch[Installed launch / exact role bytes / fd7 record]
  launch --> child[Original product child / fixed preload / same ESM registration]
  child --> helper[Fixed core helper / fd3 reply / fd4 authority]
  helper --> receiver[Kernel receiver / pid credentials control bytes]
  receiver --> node[Original factory Node sends response on fd5]
  subjects --> node
  node --> trust[Fixed trust adapter / two subject originals / request hash]
  trust --> core[Core begin / result / same run and stdout admission]
  core --> frame[Full accepted exact frame only]
  core -- denied or output unknown --> metadata[Metadata only / null result original]
  frame --> store[Private nonreplacement originals / pending retained]
  metadata --> store
  store --> reply[Recorded raw or unknown / no reporting or resource permission]
  child --> settle[Original execution and broker settle / no retry]
  settle --> leases[Settle pending verifier I/O then release product and factory SH]
  executor -- missing before SH attempt --> fallback[Ordinary invocation once]
  product -- decline before child --> sentinel[Private no-launch sentinel]
  sentinel --> released{Both canonical wrappers completed cleanup?}
  released -- yes --> fallback
  released -- no or unknown --> stopped[No child / no fallback / fixed failure]
  issuer[Actual issuer / store / resource catalogue / all-writer participation unknown] -. no success default .-> subjects
